     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Expressions of frequency",
     "texto": [
      "The usual scale of frequency:\\n\\n**siempre** → **casi siempre** → **normalmente** → **a menudo** → **a veces** → **casi nunca** → **nunca**\\n\\nTo count how regularly something happens we use: **una vez / dos veces** + **a la semana**, **al mes**, **al año**.\\nTo talk about parts of the day we use **por la tarde**, **por la noche**."
     ],
